Shown merit and ability as reflected in work performance and results; and
Demonstrated a high degree of professional competence, administrative capabilities and initiative in the general organization and management of the human resource and a thorough understanding of the human resource issues and emerging human resource management practices/ techniques
Duties and responsibilities in the field office will entail;
Analysing the human resource management and development structures and systems;
Determining and proposing methods/strategies for handling the human resource management and development function;
Initiating and developing human resource management and development policies; proposing performance improvement strategies that are adaptive to the changing environment and technology;
